WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.475 --> 00:00:02.731
JOHN ROBERTS LIVE AT THE WHITE

00:00:02.732 --> 00:00:03.090
HOUSE.

00:00:03.091 --> 00:00:03.410
THANKS.

00:00:03.411 --> 00:00:04.250
TRACE.

00:00:04.285 --> 00:00:09.046
&gt;&gt; Trace: THE NEW YORK BAR

00:00:09.080 --> 00:00:13.058
CO-OWNER IS NOW FACING CHARGES

00:00:13.060 --> 00:00:15.077
FOR ALLEGING RAMMING HIS CAR

00:00:15.078 --> 00:00:16.831
INTO SHERIFFS DEPUTIES.

00:00:16.832 --> 00:00:18.789
THEY RELEASED THIS VIDEO OF THE

00:00:18.790 --> 00:00:19.531
INCIDENT.

00:00:19.532 --> 00:00:21.551
PRESTI SAID THE OFFICERS DIDN’T

00:00:21.552 --> 00:00:22.387
IDENTIFY THEMSELVES.

00:00:22.421 --> 00:00:24.817
LAURA INGLE IS LIVE IN STATEN

00:00:24.852 --> 00:00:26.006
ISLAND, NEW YORK.

00:00:26.040 --> 00:00:27.624
WHAT ELSE IS PRESTI SAYING IN

00:00:27.626 --> 00:00:28.354
MISS DEFENSE?

00:00:28.388 --> 00:00:30.080
&gt;&gt; HE IS SAYING, TRACE, THAT HE

00:00:30.115 --> 00:00:31.634
DIDN’T DO ANYTHING WRONG WHEN

00:00:31.668 --> 00:00:33.042
IT COMES TO THAT INCIDENT WITH

00:00:33.043 --> 00:00:34.445
THE SHERIFFS DEPUTIES BECAUSE

00:00:34.480 --> 00:00:36.772
HE TRULY THOUGHT THAT HE WAS IN

00:00:36.807 --> 00:00:38.221
FEAR FOR HIS LIFE.

00:00:38.222 --> 00:00:39.347
WE’RE STANDING OUTSIDE OF THE

00:00:39.349 --> 00:00:40.110
PUB NOW.

00:00:40.145 --> 00:00:42.820
MAC’S PUBLIC HOUSE.

00:00:42.854 --> 00:00:46.674
THE NEW YORK CITY SHERIFF’S

00:00:46.707 --> 00:00:48.505
DEPUTIES SAY THEY WERE

00:00:48.539 --> 00:00:50.300
OBSERVING PRESTI AND HIS CREW

00:00:50.334 --> 00:00:52.224
WATCHING THROUGH A SIDE

00:00:52.259 --> 00:00:53.712
ENTRANCE BUT THEN AFTER

00:00:53.713 --> 00:00:55.699
MIDNIGHT THEY SAY THE PRIEST

00:00:55.701 --> 00:00:57.897
TEE CAME OUT THE FRONT DOOR AND

00:00:57.898 --> 00:00:58.923
WALKED DOWN THIS BLOCK.

00:00:58.925 --> 00:01:00.971
A HALF BLOCK AWAY AND RIGHT

00:01:00.973 --> 00:01:03.067
WHEN HE TURNED THE CORNER THAT

00:01:03.101 --> 00:01:06.092
IS WHEN THE INCIDENT WENT DOWN

00:01:06.126 --> 00:01:07.344
WITH THE SHERIFF’S DEPUTIES.

00:01:07.345 --> 00:01:08.194
PRESTI’S ATTORNEY PROVIDING

00:01:08.195 --> 00:01:10.209
THIS VIDEO OF THE INCIDENT.

00:01:10.243 --> 00:01:13.008
THE NEW YORK CITY SHERIFF SAYS

00:01:13.009 --> 00:01:14.720
THE TWO OFFICERS IDENTIFIED

00:01:14.754 --> 00:01:15.965
THEMSELVES BEFORE PRESTI RAN

00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:17.327
INSIDE HIS JEEP HITTING AND

00:01:17.329 --> 00:01:19.647
CARRYING THE DEPUTY ON THE HOOD

00:01:19.682 --> 00:01:21.771
OF THE CAR 100 YARDS.

00:01:21.772 --> 00:01:23.869
PRESTI CLAIMS THE TWO PEOPLE

00:01:23.870 --> 00:01:25.850
DRESSED IN DARK CLOTHING NEVER

00:01:25.885 --> 00:01:26.460
IDENTIFIED THEMSELVES.

00:01:26.494 --> 00:01:27.824
HIS ATTORNEY SAYS THAT PRESTI

00:01:27.825 --> 00:01:29.475
FEARED FOR HIS LIFE AND THOUGHT

00:01:29.509 --> 00:01:33.257
HE WAS ABOUT TO BE ROBBED OR

00:01:33.291 --> 00:01:33.600
JUMPED.

00:01:33.601 --> 00:01:35.514
&gt;&gt; HE DOESN’T SLAM INTO WHOEVER

00:01:35.515 --> 00:01:37.360
IS ON THE HOOD OF THE CAR.

00:01:37.394 --> 00:01:39.231
HE SLOWLY STARTS TO DRIVE AWAY

00:01:39.232 --> 00:01:40.481
WITH THE HOPES THAT THE PEOPLE

00:01:40.515 --> 00:01:43.235
THAT ARE ATTACKING HIM ARE

00:01:43.236 --> 00:01:45.689
GOING TO GET OUT OF THE WAY.

00:01:45.690 --> 00:01:48.080
&gt;&gt; THE NEW YORK CITY SHERIFF

00:01:48.082 --> 00:01:52.154
HAD A DIFFERENT TAKE SAYING TWO

00:01:52.188 --> 00:01:53.591
UNFORMED DEPUTIES IDENTIFIED

00:01:53.625 --> 00:01:55.830
THEMSELVES AND APPROACHED MR.

00:01:55.831 --> 00:01:59.090
PRESTI AND TRIED TO TAKE HIM

00:01:59.124 --> 00:02:00.395
INTO CUSTODY FOR CRIMINAL

00:02:00.429 --> 00:02:00.959
THINGS OBSERVED.

00:02:00.960 --> 00:02:02.558
THE PURSUING DEPUTIES ORDERED

00:02:02.559 --> 00:02:04.417
HIM TO STOP BUT HE FAILED TO

00:02:04.451 --> 00:02:06.168
COMPLY AND ENTERED HIS VEHICLE.

00:02:06.170 --> 00:02:08.783
THE BAR HAS BEEN THE SITE OF

00:02:08.818 --> 00:02:10.270
PROTESTS AFTER OWNERS DECLARED

00:02:10.304 --> 00:02:12.424
IT AN AUTONOMOUS ZONE REFUSING

00:02:12.425 --> 00:02:14.528
TO CLOSE EVEN AFTER THEIR

00:02:14.562 --> 00:02:16.056
LIQUOR LISTENS WAS SUSPENDED

00:02:16.058 --> 00:02:17.235
FOR IGNORING COVID RESTRICTIONS

00:02:17.236 --> 00:02:18.605
AND PRESTI’S ATTORNEY TOLD ME

00:02:18.639 --> 00:02:19.646
EARLIER THIS MORNING THEY PLAN

00:02:19.680 --> 00:02:21.370
ON HAVING A CHAT LATER TODAY ON

00:02:21.405 --> 00:02:23.398
THE PHONE AND THEN THEY’LL GET

00:02:23.399 --> 00:02:24.868
THEIR DUCKS IN ORDER AS THEY

00:02:24.902 --> 00:02:26.660
PROCEED TO FIGHT THESE CHARGES

00:02:26.661 --> 00:02:28.065
AND TRY TO GET THIS BAR

00:02:28.066 --> 00:02:28.549
REOPENED.

